\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 . Glory be to God Jehovah:
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Praise and honour to his name!
\par For his light will shine like morning,
\par Like the sun's bright dazzling flame.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We shall see the nations coming
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Out of darkness into light:
\par They shall meet before his glory
\par And submit to his great might.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Glory be to God the Saviour
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For he's made us all his own,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 May we yield a fruitful harvest,
\par Multiplying what he's sown.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  King of glory, wake the nations!
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  Go before us, show the way;
\par  And prepare us for the harvest
\par  On that great and glorious day.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Glory be to God Jehovah:
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  For the grace on His children :/:
\par They are like a fresh field for Him,:/:
\par \pard       And has all the glory in them. :/:\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

